      "content": "Lack of electrolytes and dehydration can definitely contribute to fatigue, but in your case, the rapid heartbeat and chest heaviness are concerning symptoms that may require medical attention. While magnesium and vitamins can help with overall health, using high doses without medical guidance is not recommended. I would strongly advise against self-treating without a doctor's diagnosis, as it may worsen the underlying issue, and potentially interact with other medications.",
