      "content": "i know, i know, but like, if it was something seriously dangerous like a heart attack or something, wouldn't it have happened by now? it's been weeks. i feel okay when i'm just sitting on the couch, it only happens when i'm moving a bit. i've read online that post-viral stuff can just mess with your energy levels for a long time. wouldn't it be more \"responsible\" to just rest up and take some supplements first before i go spend $500 on an ER visit that'll probably just tell me i'm stressed? what do you think is the most likely cause?",
